  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced today that it has priced an offering to sell $600 million of senior unsecured notes due 2028 (the &quot;Notes&quot;). The Notes will bear interest at 3.650% per year and, unless previously redeemed, will mature on&nbsp;March 7, 2028. The Notes are expected to settle on&nbsp;March 7, 2018, subject to the satisfaction of customary closing conditions.</p>\n<p>See full release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-Corporation-announces-pricing-of-600-million-senior-notes-offering/default.aspx\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2019 18:30:57 GMT+0000",
